# v16.0.0-Beal-44-13-Level-26-Cumulative-Archive DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22728705 at 9ce2980: docs-only cumulative archive v10-v15 most current NOT final; Lean 0 lines vs v15 6443f81 / 10.5281/zenodo.22728624. Series concept 10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
# v15.0.0-Baker-B0-PARI-Certificate DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22728624 at 6443f81: PARI gp B0=1e6 Matveev explicit Table 1 baker_B0_certificate.json transparent List/Int cert; baker_bound_gap3 stays def Prop; Tate/Baker 0 lines vs v14 3089bec.
# v14.0.0-J0-Mwrank-Formal-Verified DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22722140 at 3089bec: explicit displayed certs J0 [[1,0,1,-5,-8],[1,-1,1,-3,3]] mwrank {0,12} formal M3 [[1,1],[0,2]] reuse Tate c4/tateF2 f2<=5; holds theorems decide/rfl no axioms.
# v13.0.0-Beal-44-13-Level-26-Modular-Elimination DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22721843: Frey Y^2=X(X-A^4)(X+B^4) tateConductor 2^{f2}*rad*13 f2<=5 + Kraus a53 vs S2(26) + five transparent List/Nat cert structures (not opaque axioms). Concept DOI still 10.5281/zenodo.22272382; v12 DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22721089.
# v12.0.0-Baker-Matveev-explicit DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22721089: explicit Matveev for (4,4,13) gap3, not general Bugeaud; matveev_explicit_gap3 turns baker_bound_gap3 into eq → B ≤ baker_B0; matveev_no_solution_A_le_B inhabited; baker_bound_gap3 stays Prop; Tate file unchanged.
# v11.0.0-Tate-N-def DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22721420: defines tateConductor / frey_tate_conductor as 2^{f2}*rad*13 and inhabits frey_tate_conductor_inhabited; baker_bound_gap3 / conductor_86 / B14_honest stay Prop.
# v10.0.0-paper-B14-Baker-1e6-DOI archives math DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22712897 and paper DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22713047 for the v9.4.0 census (62500 / 25 chunks), Baker conditional forall B, and Tate 2^5*rad*13.
# v9.4.0-chunked-1e6-final names allKilled_chunk_0..24 and allKilled_62500 / allKilled_1e6; baker_conditional_gap3_full stays inhabited; baker_bound_gap3 / frey_tate_conductor / conductor_86 / B14_honest stay Prop.
# v9.3.0-Baker-conditional-gap3-full inhabits baker_conditional_gap3_full; baker_bound_gap3 stays Prop.
